SPOILER

A blessed genocide genocides all monsters of a class everywhere.
An uncursed genocide genocides all monsters of a type everywhere.
A cursed genocide creates the type of monster you specify.

A class is all monsters of the same letter, eg L.
A type is a particular monster, eg Lich.


Strategy follows:

MORE SPOILERS


Don't get carried away with genociding monsters, because the same number of
monsters will get randomly generated no matter how many you genocide, they
will just be the un genocided ones. Not all monsters are genocideable.

My policy is to wipe out all L's, because they annoyingly curse things. 
Everything else i leave alone. If i find any more genocide scrolls and
my character is not invincible :-) yet then i keep them to get out of tight
situations, eg being chased by heaps of a particluar monster and down
on hit points. Otherwise i will curse the scroll and call up some wraiths
for some easy experience points.


